            // into sentences and synthesised as the text arrives, the first
            // sentence while the model is still writing the rest — and held: nothing
            // joins the speech queue, so nothing reaches the wire, until the turn is
            // confirmed. Then whatever has been made goes out at once and the rest
            // streams behind it. Withdrawn, the preparation stops with the token and
